<title>HONG KONG: Climax Int'l in management reshuffle.</title>
<headline>Climax Int'l in management reshuffle.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Climax International Co Ltd said on Friday it appointed Kenneth Fung as chairman.</p>
<p>Fung, currently managing director and chief executive, will replace his father Fung Kwong-yan who is retiring from day-to-day duties, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The elder Fung has been appointed honorary chairman with a non-executive director's role, it said.</p>
<p>Fung Yip Wai Ming, currently executive director, has been appointed vice chairman.</p>
<p>The appointments will take effect from February 1.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
